and before `yield`, so that an explicit transaction is started:\n> If [isolation_level](https://docs.python.org/3/library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3.Connection.isolation_level) is set to None, no transactions are implicitly opened at all. This leaves the underlying SQLite library in [autocommit mode](https://www.sqlite.org/lang_transaction.html#implicit_versus_explicit_transactions), but also allows the user to perform their own transaction handling using explicit SQL statements.\n\nhttps://docs.python.org/3/library/sqlite3.html#sqlite3-transaction-control-isolation-level\n\nThe last part `but also allows the user to perform their own transaction handling using explicit SQL statements.` is what an explicit `BEGIN` would allow.", "raw_modified_targets": ["sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/disable_wal", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/enable_wal", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/ensure_autocommit_off", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/query"], "rejected_targets": [{"id": "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/disable_wal", "issue_pr_match": true, "label": "necessary_helper", "reason": "unverified_or_not_in_base_graph"}, {"id": "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/enable_wal", "issue_pr_match": true, "label": "necessary_helper", "reason": "unverified_or_not_in_base_graph"}, {"id": "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/query", "issue_pr_match": true, "label": "necessary_helper", "reason": "unverified_or_not_in_base_graph"}], "repo": "simonw/sqlite-utils", "retrieval_k": 10, "retrieval_seeds": ["sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/ensure_autocommit_off", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/atomic", "tests/test_constructor.py/test_autocommit_connections_are_rejected", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/_ensure_no_open_transaction", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/begin", "tests/test_atomic.py/test_execute_comment_prefixed_begin_leaves_transaction_open", "tests/test_atomic.py/test_execute_write_commits_immediately", "tests/test_atomic.py/test_begin_inside_transaction_errors", "sqlite_utils/db.py/Database/query", "tests/test_constructor.py/test_